# ── Product Image Storage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Uploaded product images are stored at the Hostinger DOMAINS ROOT level:
#   /home/u981836125/domains/omgproductsimages/
#
# This folder is completely OUTSIDE the GitHub repository and outside public_html.
# It is NEVER committed to Git, NEVER deployed, and NEVER deleted on redeploy.
# Images placed there persist permanently regardless of code pushes.
#
# The old backend/uploads/ path is no longer used.
backend/uploads/*
!backend/uploads/.gitkeep
